  "content": "\n\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/fd08bb24ec90c58bb3f76a974cfdd7806cd5f2a6.png\" alt=\"Pack Logo\"> <img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/98bd6443815ed67b446e4078572df491330d8c77.gif\" alt=\"Comparison\"></p>\n<p><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/colorful-pots\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/intergrav/devins-badges/v3/assets/compact/available/curseforge_vector.svg\" alt=\"\"></a><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fresourcepack%252fcolorful-pots\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/intergrav/devins-badges/v3/assets/compact/available/modrinth_vector.svg\" alt=\"\"></a><a href=\"https://discord.gg/FgypubrVmn\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/intergrav/devins-badges/c7fd18efdadd1c3f12ae56b49afd834640d2d797/assets/compact/social/discord-plural_vector.svg\" alt=\"\"></a></p>\n<hr>\n<h3><strong>📋 Описание</strong></h3>\n<p>Colourful Pots визуально улучшает цветочные горшки, добавляя каждому уникальную текстуру в зависимости от посаженного растения. Пакет предназначен для Minecraft версий 1.19–1.21 и может не работать с другими версиями.</p>\n<hr>\n<h3><strong>⚠️ Установка</strong></h3>\n<p><strong>Данный пакет является дополнением к Flower Pots + и будет работать только при активации обоих ресурс-паков</strong></p>\n<p><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/flower-pots\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/q7rNnpQc/b45b9836177f5f3700ac716427310d7de999df72_96.webp\" alt=\"Flower Pots +\"></a></p>\n<hr>\n<h3><strong>⚙️ Совместимость</strong></h3>\n<p>Colourful Pots на данный момент поддерживает 6 различных модов:</p>\n<p><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/autumnity\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cRh6MJ6n/e52c9f8a03475093aed41835661de4e323fe1c42_96.webp\" alt=\"Autumnity\"></a> <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/buzzier-bees\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/b7vOFSIp/70e4d531729366d5da5630799a19faae98b66ccd_96.webp\" alt=\"Buzzier Bees\"></a> <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/endergetic\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cPle5Z8G/ab7116346e31a34af404241ed137526a8e13ef1c_96.webp\" alt=\"The Endergetic Expansion\"></a> <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/neapolitan\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/InYMuiQt/da8f163e363ccca56701eb1fdbb8f04fcfeb3fc5_96.webp\" alt=\"Neapolitan\"></a> <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/quark\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/qnQsVE2z/aef2119751d026421b9e9dc83d4470eec9f91a16_96.webp\" alt=\"Quark\"></a> <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/upgrade-aquatic\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/gTuTFFyz/a3a5d5ecbb899b2808fd0c9140cf3fc421ece9fd_96.webp\" alt=\"Upgrade Aquatic\"></a></p>\n<hr>\n<p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fbisecthosting.com%252fwenan\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://www.bisecthosting.com/partners/custom-banners/bcba9f8e-a0c9-4f08-bde0-062c2961d73e.webp\" alt=\"\"></a></p>\n<h6>© 2024 WeNAN Studios. Все права защищены.</h6>",
